Beings tremble at Rāma's wrathful face --- Gods and asuras watch the duel from the sky --- Rāvaṇa seizes a blazing pike and boasts --- Rāvaṇa hurls the pike at Rāma --- Rāma meets it with arrow volleys --- The pike burns Rāma's arrows --- Rāma hurls Indra's javelin and splits the pike --- Rāma wounds Rāvaṇa's horses and bloodies Rāvaṇa
